WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.5 · Marketing & Communications
Website, SEO and discoverability

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Build your website around what visitors come to do, and help them find it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give each priority audience a clear page and task.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Use the words people type when they search.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name an owner for each page; review twice a year.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Get something fixed, borrow a tool, shop at Riverside Reuse, volunteer, schools: each page has one owner.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your site structure and a discoverability plan.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
